  <name>Nocturne</name>
  <summary>Remembers your day and hands you one page each morning</summary>
  <developer id="is.nocturne">
    <name>Nocturne</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Nocturne is a private app that remembers your day. Keep a photo of a letter, a voice note,
      a file or a line of text as you go. Overnight it reads them, joins them up and lets go of
      what you no longer need. In the morning you get one page: what changed, what needs you and
      one question.
    </p>
    <p>
      Ask it anything and it answers only from what you kept, with the original as proof.
      Everything stays on this computer. It goes online only to download what you agree to.
    </p>
  </description>
